<div :for={page_staff <- @staff} class="p-2 break-after-page">
  <h1 class="text-center text-4xl font-bold">Chathams ledger</h1>
  <p class="mt-2 text-center">
    Please write in the cost of items being purchased in each box. Only write
    one number per box and if you run out of boxes please write your name and
    sid in a blank row at the end of these sheets. If for example you are buying
    two items at once, one that is 50 cents and another that is 1 dollar, then
    write 1.5 next to the dollar sign.
  </p>

  <table class="mt-4 w-full border-2">
    <tbody>
      <tr
        :for={{person, idx} <- Enum.with_index(page_staff)}
        class="flex"
      >
        <th class="p-3 border-2">
          <span>{person.full_name}</span> (<span>{person.sid}</span>)
        </th>
        <td
          :for={i <- 10..1//-1}
          class="flex-grow-1 border-2 text-lg py-3 px-1"
        >
          $
        </td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>
